Touch edge rejection setting for the Touchscreen KCM of plasma-desktop 6.7.5
(branch touchscreen-edge-rejection in ~/Workspace/src/plasma-desktop, not
upstream): "Ignore touches starting near the edge" (Off, 0.5 to 10 mm) with
the width in pixels, bound to KWin's touchEdgeRejectionWidth. Needs the KWin
patch kwin-6.7.5-touch-edge-rejection.patch at build time (D-Bus interface).

Generated with: git diff v6.7.5 touchscreen-edge-rejection-6.7.5 -- . ':!kcms/libkwindevices/tests'
in ~/Workspace/src/plasma-desktop-6.7.5 (the tests ran on that branch).
Applies with -p1 to plasma-desktop-6.7.5.tar.xz after
plasma-desktop-6.1.80-override-include-dirs.patch.

